@host = http://localhost:5080

### Profile
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/profile

### Skills
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/skills

### Projects
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/projects

### Education
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/education

### Certifications
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/certifications

### Send a contact message (valid)
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "subject": "Hello",
  "message": "This is a test message from the .http file."
}

### Send a contact message (invalid, returns 400 with the problems)
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "subject": "",
  "message": "short"
}
